          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "<span class=\"ul-b\">Proportion</span> in context means using <span class=\"ul-k\">scaling</span> to solve everyday problems: adapting recipes, reading maps, converting currencies, or comparing rates."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "<span class=\"rb\">Method:</span> Find the value of one unit (unitary method), then multiply to find the amount needed."
        }
      ]
    },
